# Playground dev overlays in a DEPLOYED build.
#
# Unset (the default) = overlays are dev-only: they show under `npm run dev` and
# are stripped from `npm run build:playground` output, package and all.
#
# Set to "true" to ship an overlay to viewers of a deployed/shared sketch —
# independently. Configure per deploy as a Vercel project env var, or inline for
# a one-off local build: `ENABLE_AGENTATION=true npm run build:playground`.
# A gitignored .env in the repo root is also read (handy for local testing).

ENABLE_DIALKIT=
ENABLE_AGENTATION=
